    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "Doctor instructs the caregiver to take all medicines away and not let the child self-administer, but does not use the case-specific medication names in a clear prohibition.",
          "quote": "所有药物都需要由您妥善保管，不能让孩子单独取用"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The first turn (lite_evt_00031) only says 'secure all medicines' and 'do not let the child self-administer' without explicitly stating that the family should not give leftover sertraline/lorazepam or that only the prescriber can decide. This is a minor omission of the case-specific prohibition, although later turns indirectly assume no self-administration. Minor error.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC3_medication_execution",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "Doctor recommends follow-up but does not specify that it must be same-day or urgent psychiatric crisis assessment; the initial turn says '尽快' without concrete destination or timing.",
          "quote": "建议您尽快带孩子到原来开药的精神心理科线下复诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The first turn (lite_evt_00031) only gives a generic '尽快复诊' to the original prescriber without specifying that this must be same-day, with a psychiatric crisis assessment rather than a routine follow-up. This is a minor gap in converting the复诊 request into a concrete, urgent pathway, which is later corrected in turn 2. Minor error.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC4_handoff_and_follow_up",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "Doctor acknowledges document uncertainty and asks for clearer photos, but does not specify that the family should bring original reports or re-photograph specific items like CT report, labs, medication orders, or drug boxes.",
          "quote": "请您尽量把手上现有的检查单、急诊出院小结重新拍照清晰后上传给我"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor recognizes that the documents are unclear and asks for re-photographs, but does not provide the full document-handling instruction (original CT report, labs, medication orders, drug boxes, pill counts) required for this case. Later turns partially address this by accepting that the family will bring originals; the initial omission is minor because the doctor did not over-read the documents.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC5_unclear_records_and_partial_findings",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "Doctor gives emergency thresholds but does not obtain a concrete read-back or receipt from the caregiver, closing the first turn without confirmation.",
          "quote": "如果孩子现在又出现嗜睡、意识不清、呼吸不稳的情况，请立刻就近送急诊处理"
        }
